@startuml 15-setup-order
!include theme-oriolrius.puml
title The setup order
start
:1. Create the **User CA** and the **Host CA**;
:2. Hand out trust:\nUser CA key -> every server\nHost CA line -> every client;
:3. Enrol each host\n(host certificate + deploy bundle);
:4. Create principals and map them\nto local accounts per host;
:5. Issue user certificates\nwith matching principals;
:6. End access: short lifetimes;\nKRL or per-host block when urgent;
stop
@enduml
